{"version":1,"content":"<p>Linux內核開發團隊已將PCI/PCIe子系統的一批更新合併至正在開發的Linux 7.4內核。這次更新除了修復PCI設備枚舉、驅動綁定和錯誤恢復等方面的問題，還特別改進了系統從休眠狀態恢復時的電源管理行為，有助於Linux設備滿足部分能源效率認證的要求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583576.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:31.132225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:31:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.514188+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.514188+00:00","content_hash":"3f0004720a822c23b58ce89aec772281d66ac5f41ece31a69e479ba5cb4182d2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}